# Docs / PRD / Roadmap

## Keep docs aligned with code
- When you change dataset schema or paths, update: `README.md`, `configs/datasets.yaml`, and any `docs/` guide.
- Prefer small, verifiable instructions (exact commands, expected folders).

## Reference the spec
- The canonical intermediate tensor is `[t, pos(3), vel(3), acc(3)]` per timestep (spec §5.2).

